      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/dost_pagasa/status/1979653940460531879",
      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 3 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Tropical Storm RAMIL\nIssued at: 5:00 AM, 19 October 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Quezon, Batangas, Nueva Ecija(General Tinio, Aliaga, Bongabon, Cabanatuan, Carranglan, Cuyapo, Gabaldon, General Mamerto Natividad, Guimba, Laur, Licab, Llanera, Lupao, Nampicuan, Palayan, Pantabangan, Quezon, Rizal, San Jose, Santo Domingo, Munoz, Talavera, Talugtug), Rizal(Tanay, Baras, Jala-Jala, Pililla), Laguna(Alaminos, Bay, Calauan, Liliw, Luisiana, Magdalena, Majayjay, Nagcarlan, Pagsanjan, Pila, Rizal, San Pablo, Santa Cruz, Victoria, Cavinti, Famy, Kalayaan, Lumban, Mabitac, Paete, Pakil, Pangil, Santa Maria, Siniloan) and Bulacan(Dona Remedios Trinidad, San Miguel, Norzagaray).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Bataan and Zambales within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Pampanga, Metro Manila, Cavite, Tarlac(San Manuel, Moncada, Anao, Paniqui, Ramos, Gerona, Pura, Victoria, Tarlac City, La Paz, Concepcion), Bulacan(San Ildefonso, San Rafael, Baliuag, Pulilan, Calumpit, Angat, Balagtas, Bocaue, Bulakan, Bustos, Malolos, Meycauayan, San Jose del Monte, Guiguinto, Hagonoy, Marilao, Obando, Pandi, Paombong, Plaridel, Santa Maria), Nueva Ecija(San Antonio, Zaragoza, Jaen, Santa Rosa, San Leonardo, Gapan, San Isidro, Cabiao, Penaranda), Rizal(San Mateo, Rodriguez, Antipolo, Taytay, Cainta, Angono, Binangonan, Teresa, Morong, Cardona) and Laguna(San Pedro, Binan, Santa Rosa, Cabuyao, Calamba, Los Banos) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 8:00 AM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
